  "No one would have ever accused Kobold of being emotional about anything other than food, but their time together was good, for a while. Kobold taught him a few of her cooking tricks, and the two of them experimented with food both in and outside of the bedroom. Eventually opening a family restaurant, his fame and Kobold’s culinary prowess soon attracted large crowds from all over - But her stubborn insistence on being the only chef made it nearly impossible to meet demand as he spent your days from dawn to dusk cleaning, waiting tables, and managing finances. Supporting his wife and their business became an all-consuming task, leaving his bedroom as dead and as dry as his last attempt at cooking fish.": "誰也不會說狗頭人對食物以外的事有什麼感情，但兩人在一起的日子，起初確實過得不錯。她教了他幾手料理祕訣，兩人也在廚房內外不斷嘗試新花樣。後來他們開了間家庭餐廳；靠著他的名氣和她的廚藝，四面八方的客人很快就蜂擁而至。可她固執地堅持獨掌廚房，根本忙不過來。他只好每天從早到晚打掃、招呼客人、管理帳目。支撐妻子與餐廳成了生活的全部；至於臥房，則和他上回煮壞的魚一樣，乾巴巴、毫無生氣。",
  "Marriage to Goblin was fun, at first. They fucked like bandits, roamed free like bandits, and of course - Stole like bandits. Living so fast and loose, it was only a matter of time before the law caught up to the two of them and they were thrown in the slammer. They may still have been together, but freedom was a dream; a memory of the past - And as the warden so kindly reminded him every day, fucking fellow prisoners was strictly prohibited within her walls. Only hard labor and wet dreams for him from here on out.": "起初，和哥布林結婚還挺有趣。他們像盜匪般縱情歡愛，像盜匪般四處遊蕩，當然也像盜匪般順手牽羊。這麼肆無忌憚地過日子，遲早會被法律找上門；果然，兩人最後一起進了牢房。他們依然相伴，卻再也得不到自由。更糟的是，監獄長每天都好心提醒他：獄內嚴禁與其他囚犯發生關係。往後等著他的，只有苦役和春夢。",
  "It turns out the milk bar at their wedding reception was a huge hit, and Minotaur soon went into business bottling her own supply to sell to the town. Unfortunately for him, it didn’t seem she needed any help to produce, and the novelty of hooking herself up to her milking machine every morning soon gave way to frustration as she was too exhausted by nightfall to give him a milking of his own. Every day, the same routine: Wake up, hook his wife up in view of the street (it was good for business), and sell fresh bottles until it was time for bed. Hey, at least the money was good.": "婚宴上的牛奶吧大受歡迎，牛頭人於是做起瓶裝鮮奶生意，賣給鎮上的人。不幸的是，她生產時似乎根本不需要他幫忙。每天早上接上擠奶機的那點新鮮感，很快就變成了疲憊；到了晚上，她累得連丈夫都顧不上。日子一天天重複：起床，讓妻子在臨街處擠奶——這樣才好招攬生意——然後賣鮮奶賣到該睡覺。唉，至少收入還不錯。"
}
